[-] ----> deal with range 
[a-z] lower case 
[A-Z] uppercase 
[0-9] digit  \d shortcut 
[a-zA-Z] alphabet 
 [a-zA-z0-9] alphanumaric  (\w shortcut)
ex:
egrep "a[0-9]c" sample.txt 
