grep "a[0-9]+c" sample.txt 
a7c 
a78c 

\s whitespace (space newline tabspace)

ex: 
search of the line which containes three words 
egrep "[a-zA-Z0-9]+\s[a-zA-Z0-9+\s[a-zA-Z0-9]" sample.txt 

shortcut way :
egrep "\w+\s+\w+\s+\w" sample.txt 

